Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.63,0:00:04.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fellow warriors, this is Sheldor the Conqueror.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.63,0:00:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的战友们 我是征服者谢耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.05,0:00:06.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We are about to enter Atzel's fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.05,0:00:06.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们将要进入阿兹提尔堡垒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.05,0:00:10.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, this is a long run, so let's do another bladder check.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.05,0:00:10.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这将会是一场持久战 要上厕所的快点去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.97,0:00:16.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, Barry, we'll wait for you again, but you really should see a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.97,0:00:16.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 贝里 我们会再等你一下 但你真的该去看医生了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.27,0:00:18.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[BANGING NEARBY]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:23.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldor is AFK.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:23.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢耳朵暂时离开
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.19,0:00:29.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny, are you experiencing some sort of difficulty?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.19,0:00:29.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 你遇到麻烦了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.78,0:00:32.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, I can't get my stupid door open.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.78,0:00:32.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的 我打不开这个破门
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.45,0:00:36.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You appear to have put your car key in the door lock. Are you aware of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.45,0:00:36.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道自己插的是汽车钥匙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:38.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:38.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.25,0:00:41.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.25,0:00:41.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.50,0:00:45.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: Damn it, damn it, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.50,0:00:45.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可恶…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.59,0:00:48.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would it be possible for you to do this a little more quietly?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.59,0:00:48.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能不能安静一点？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.13,0:00:52.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I can't get the damn key out. -That's not surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.13,0:00:52.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我的钥匙卡住了 -这也难怪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.72,0:00:56.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That Baldwin lock on your door uses traditional edge-mounted cylinders...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.72,0:00:56.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你家的那个门锁 使用的是传统的固定式圆柱…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.26,0:01:00.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...whereas the key for your Volkswagen uses a center-cylinder system.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.26,0:01:00.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而你大众车的钥匙 用的是中央式圆柱系统
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.31,0:01:03.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.31,0:01:03.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢提醒 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.48,0:01:06.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.48,0:01:06.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:10.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Point of inquiry: Why did you put your car key in the door lock?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:10.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想请问一下 你为何把车钥匙插到门锁上？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.40,0:01:12.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll tell you why. Today I had an audition.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.40,0:01:12.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么？我来告诉你为什么 因为我今天有个试镜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:15.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It took me two hours to get there. I waited an hour for my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:15.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我开了两个小时的车才到那边 然后等了一小时才轮到我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.74,0:01:18.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Before I could start, they told me I look too Midwest for the part.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.74,0:01:18.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我还没开始 他们却说 我的长相太中西部 不符合那个角色
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.08,0:01:21.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Too Midwest. What the hell does that even mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.08,0:01:21.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太中西部了 这是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.46,0:01:26.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The American Midwest was mostly settled by Scandinavian and Germanic peoples...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.46,0:01:26.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}美国中西部的居民大多是 斯堪的纳维亚与德国人的后裔…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:29.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...who have characteristic facial-- -I know what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:29.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他们的脸部特征就是… -我知道那是什么意思 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.59,0:01:33.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}God, I have been in L.A. for almost two years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.59,0:01:33.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天 我来洛杉矶都快两年了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.51,0:01:36.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I haven't gotten a single acting job. I've accomplished nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.51,0:01:36.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}连一个演出机会都没找到 我一无所成
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.85,0:01:39.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Haven't gotten a raise at work. Haven't even had sex in six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.85,0:01:39.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}工作上没被加薪 过去的六个月里也毫无性爱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.10,0:01:45.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And when I was walking up those stairs a fly flew in my mouth and I ate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.10,0:01:45.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚上楼时 一只苍蝇 飞进我嘴里 而且还被我吃掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.15,0:01:49.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, actually, insects are a dietary staple in many cultures.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.15,0:01:49.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其实在许多文化中 昆虫算是主食
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.19,0:01:50.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're almost pure protein.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.19,0:01:50.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它们富含蛋白质
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.57,0:01:54.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.57,0:01:54.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}狗娘养的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.49,0:01:56.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The condensation on your frozen foods...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.49,0:01:56.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你那些冷冻食物解冻造成的水珠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.70,0:01:59.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...weakened the structural integrity of the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.70,0:01:59.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}破坏了纸袋的结构
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.83,0:02:07.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But returning to your key conundrum, you should call a locksmith.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.83,0:02:07.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过回到你钥匙的谜题上 你应该找开锁的来…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.29,0:02:09.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Have him open the door for you. -I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.29,0:02:09.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-请他帮你开门 -我打过了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.34,0:02:11.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He said he'll get here when he gets here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.34,0:02:11.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说他想来的时候就会来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.63,0:02:15.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're frustrated because he phrased his reply in a meaningless tautology?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.63,0:02:15.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以你感到沮丧是因为 他的回应是无意义的赘述？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.34,0:02:19.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. I am frustrated because I am a failure at everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.34,0:02:19.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我很沮丧是因为我一无是处…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.56,0:02:22.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and my breath smells like fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.56,0:02:22.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就连我的口气都有苍蝇的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.06,0:02:24.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CRYING]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.44,0:02:27.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.44,0:02:27.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.36,0:02:38.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would you prefer to wait in our apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.36,0:02:38.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要不要来我们家等？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.24,0:02:41.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I'd rather sit on this freezing floor, sobbing like a 3-year-old.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.24,0:02:41.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我想坐在这冰冷的地上 像个三岁的小孩一样地哭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.45,0:02:44.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.45,0:02:44.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.08,0:02:47.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.08,0:02:47.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.54,0:02:52.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just when I think I've gotten the hang of sarcasm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.54,0:02:52.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还以为我开始懂讽刺的意思了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.28,0:03:19.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Make yourself comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.28,0:03:19.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不用拘束
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.82,0:03:21.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.82,0:03:21.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不能坐那边
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:24.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SCOFFS]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.06,0:03:53.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldor is back online.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.06,0:03:53.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢耳朵回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.32,0:03:55.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldor?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.32,0:03:55.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢耳朵？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.61,0:03:58.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The Conqueror.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.61,0:03:58.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}征服者
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.49,0:04:00.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.49,0:04:00.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.03,0:04:03.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}AFK.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.03,0:04:03.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}暂离
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.83,0:04:07.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm playing "Age of Conan," an online multiplayer game...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.83,0:04:07.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我正在玩《科南时代》 这是一种多人线上游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.87,0:04:11.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...set in the universe of Robert E. Howard's Conan the Barbarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.87,0:04:11.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}背景是罗伯特E霍华德创造的 科南野蛮宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.67,0:04:12.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.13,0:04:16.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldor back online.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.13,0:04:16.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢耳朵回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.17,0:04:19.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's AFK? -AFK.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.17,0:04:19.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-AFK是什么意思？ -AFK
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.05,0:04:24.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Away from keyboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.05,0:04:24.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是“暂离”的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.18,0:04:26.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.18,0:04:26.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.52,0:04:29.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What does that stand for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.52,0:04:29.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那又是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.06,0:04:36.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.06,0:04:36.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.40,0:04:40.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, but what does it stand for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.40,0:04:40.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的 但那是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.63,0:04:56.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And just click on the enchanted boots to put them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.63,0:04:56.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只要点这个魔法靴子 就可以将它们穿上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.63,0:05:00.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. Can I see them in another color?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.63,0:05:00.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不确定 有没有其他颜色？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.59,0:05:02.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just click on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.59,0:05:02.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}点下去就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.01,0:05:07.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, congratulations, you are now a level-three warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.01,0:05:07.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恭喜了 你是三级战士了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.10,0:05:10.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's going on? -Guess what? I'm a level-three warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.10,0:05:10.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么回事？ -你知道吗？我是三级战士了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.27,0:05:14.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you know there are groceries outside of your apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.27,0:05:14.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了 你知道你家外面有一堆杂货吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.23,0:05:15.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, yeah, yeah. Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.23,0:05:15.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.52,0:05:20.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I only bring it up because your ice cream's melting and it's starting to attract wildlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.52,0:05:20.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我提这事是因为 融化的冰淇淋引来了野生动物
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.28,0:05:24.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh-huh. Do I stay in the jungle or go towards the beach?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.28,0:05:24.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要留在丛林里还是去海边？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.16,0:05:27.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Doesn't matter, you're looking for treasure. -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.16,0:05:27.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-无所谓 你现在正在找宝藏 -好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.58,0:05:32.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Wait, where are you going? -Go ahead. You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.58,0:05:32.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-等等 你去哪？ -继续玩吧 你可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.16,0:05:35.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you run into crocodiles, just kick them with your boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.16,0:05:35.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你碰到了鳄鱼 就用靴子踢它们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.84,0:05:40.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wanna catch me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.84,0:05:40.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要不要告诉我发生了什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.51,0:05:44.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, uh, let's see. She attempted to open her apartment with her car key...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.51,0:05:44.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是这样的 她试着用车钥匙 来开她公寓的门
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.26,0:05:47.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because her face is overly Midwestern. Uh....
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.26,0:05:47.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为她的长相太过中西部
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.35,0:05:50.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She hasn't had sex in six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.35,0:05:50.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且六个月没有做爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.93,0:05:53.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And she ate a fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.93,0:05:53.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且她还吃了一只苍蝇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.94,0:05:56.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.02,0:05:59.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Seriously, six months?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.02,0:05:59.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的？六个月了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.48,0:06:01.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God, a treasure chest. I'm rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.48,0:06:01.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天 宝藏箱 我变成有钱人了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.40,0:06:05.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Level three and she thinks she's rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.40,0:06:05.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}才第三级她就觉得自己是有钱人了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.49,0:06:10.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What a newb.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.49,0:06:10.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是个菜鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.62,0:06:15.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, we're all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.62,0:06:15.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我们准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.75,0:06:17.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let her rip.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.75,0:06:17.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.14,0:06:32.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hi. -Hey, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.14,0:06:32.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-大家好 -你好 快来看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.81,0:06:34.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just corn starch and water.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.81,0:06:34.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这就是玉米淀粉糊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.02,0:06:40.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They make up a non-Newtonian fluid which is liquid...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.02,0:06:40.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它们本来是液态的非牛顿流体
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.82,0:06:43.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but solid under the percussive action of the speaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.82,0:06:43.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但在重低音喇叭的冲击下变成固体
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.61,0:06:46.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's what makes it get all funky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.61,0:06:46.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以它才这么会跳
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.66,0:06:51.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.66,0:06:51.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.29,0:06:53.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen, I need to talk to Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.29,0:06:53.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 我要跟谢尔顿聊聊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.50,0:07:00.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, that's what she said, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.50,0:07:00.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 她说的就是谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.80,0:07:04.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I bought the game and I've been exploring the Island of Tortage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.80,0:07:04.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我买了那个游戏 然后在塔吉岛探险
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:06.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't figure how to pass the guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:06.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我不知道怎么通过守卫队长
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.47,0:07:09.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Do you have the enchanted sword? -I have a bronze dagger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.47,0:07:09.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你有魔法之剑吗？ -我有一把青铜匕首
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.35,0:07:11.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't slay the guard with a dagger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.35,0:07:11.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你无法用匕首将守卫杀死
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.39,0:07:14.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Lord, it's like the car key in your apartment door all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.39,0:07:14.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天 这就像是 你又用车钥匙开家门一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.73,0:07:17.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-How do I get the sword? -Have you been to the Temple of Mitra?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.73,0:07:17.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好 我如何才能得到剑？ -你去过米特拉圣殿了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.81,0:07:20.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Is that the place on the hill with the priest? -No, it's--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.81,0:07:20.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是山上有个怪牧师的地方吗？ -不…那在…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.69,0:07:22.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, for God's sakes, give me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.69,0:07:22.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}算了 给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.48,0:07:24.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you. I really appreciate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.48,0:07:24.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢 真的很感谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.32,0:07:26.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have to learn to do these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.32,0:07:26.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得学着自己来 佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.40,0:07:28.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't patronize me. Just get the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.40,0:07:28.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别对我说教 快帮我拿剑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.70,0:07:32.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What the frak?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.70,0:07:32.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}搞什么鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.83,0:07:36.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Beats me. They were playing all last night too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.83,0:07:36.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也搞不懂 他们昨晚也玩了一整夜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.04,0:07:40.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's like some kind of weird comic-book crossover.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.04,0:07:40.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他俩就像是某种奇怪的漫画组合
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.54,0:07:44.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like if Hulk were dating Peppermint Patty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.54,0:07:44.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就像是绿巨人浩克 在跟薄荷馅饼佩蒂约会
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.34,0:07:46.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I always thought Peppermint Patty was a lesbian.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.34,0:07:46.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一直以为薄荷馅饼佩蒂是拉拉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.67,0:07:47.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, that's Marcie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.67,0:07:47.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不对 那是玛西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.01,0:07:50.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Peppermint Patty's just athletic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.01,0:07:50.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}薄荷馅饼佩蒂只是很爱好运动
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.39,0:07:53.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There you go, one enchanted sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.39,0:07:53.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 一把魔法之剑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.47,0:07:56.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, give me, give me. I wanna kill the guard captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.47,0:07:56.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 给我…我要杀了守卫队长
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.06,0:08:03.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That girl needs to get a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.06,0:08:03.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那女孩真的需要找点事情做
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.41,0:08:13.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.66,0:08:17.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.66,0:08:17.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.34,0:08:26.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon. -Danger. Danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.34,0:08:26.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 -危险…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.84,0:08:28.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No danger, it's me, Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.84,0:08:28.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有危险 是我 佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.26,0:08:31.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen, I got to level 25 and reached Purple Lotus Swamp, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.26,0:08:31.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 我打到了25级 然后到了紫莲花沼泽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.72,0:08:33.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You're in my bedroom. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.72,0:08:33.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你在我房间里 -没错
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.93,0:08:37.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Leonard gave me an emergency key. -People can't be in my bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.93,0:08:37.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德给了我紧急钥匙 -谁都不能进我的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.72,0:08:41.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Can we go talk in the living room? -I'm not wearing pajama bottoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.72,0:08:41.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好 我们可以去客厅说吗？ -我没穿睡裤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.52,0:08:45.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why not? -I spilled grape juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.52,0:08:45.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-为什么不穿？ -我打翻了葡萄汁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.48,0:08:46.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, wear different pajamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.48,0:08:46.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就穿另外一件
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.07,0:08:50.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can't wear different pajamas. These are my Monday pajamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.07,0:08:50.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不能穿另外一件 这套是周一专用的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.86,0:08:52.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny, people cannot be in my bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.86,0:08:52.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 外人不能进我房间
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.20,0:08:56.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just tell me, is it too soon to join a quest to the Black Castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.20,0:08:56.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 那你告诉我 现在就去探索黑城堡会不会太早？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.83,0:08:59.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You were invited on a quest to the Black Castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.83,0:08:59.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有人邀你去探索黑城堡？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.66,0:09:03.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}By some guys in Budapest. I'm just not sure it's the right move for my character.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.66,0:09:03.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 某个在布达佩斯的人 我不确定我的角色这样做好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.21,0:09:06.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course it's not. You're only a level 25.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.21,0:09:06.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然不好 你才到25级
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.13,0:09:10.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}These Hungarians are just using you for dragon fodder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.13,0:09:10.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那些匈牙利人只是想利用你 当巨龙的诱饵
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.13,0:09:15.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? Boy, you'd think you could trust a horde of Hungarian Barbarians.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.13,0:09:15.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？我还以为那群 野蛮的匈牙利人很可信
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.68,0:09:19.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Please, Penny, enough. I have to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.68,0:09:19.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 佩妮 够了 我要睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.94,0:09:24.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: Okay, well, you were great. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.94,0:09:24.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 你真是太棒了 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.82,0:09:30.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Listen, don't go in Sheldon's room. He's not wearing bottoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.82,0:09:30.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 别去谢尔顿的房间 他没穿裤子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.87,0:09:37.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.04,0:09:40.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, you wanna catch me up again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.04,0:09:40.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你要不要再跟我解释一下 发生了什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.66,0:09:44.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}People, I am very busy today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.66,0:09:44.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}两位 我今天很忙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.04,0:09:48.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I realize that, but it is your job as head of the department...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.04,0:09:48.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道 盖布尓豪瑟博士 但你身为系主任…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.34,0:09:50.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to mediate all intra-departmental disputes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.34,0:09:50.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有责任调解系内的分歧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.59,0:09:53.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}University Policy Manual, Chapter 4, subsection 2:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.59,0:09:53.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是大学规章手册第四章第二款
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.01,0:09:55.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Mediation of Intra-departmental Disputes."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.01,0:09:55.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《调解系内分歧》规定的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.64,0:09:56.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SCOFFS]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.64,0:09:57.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.85,0:09:58.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.52,0:10:02.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Winkle, what colorful name did you call Dr. Cooper this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.52,0:10:02.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}温克尔博士 你这次又帮 库珀博士取了什么精彩的绰号？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.85,0:10:04.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Dumb-ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.85,0:10:04.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}白痴博士
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.98,0:10:09.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Cooper, Dr. Winkle apologizes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.98,0:10:09.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}库珀博士 温克尔博士向你道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.52,0:10:10.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No, she doesn't. -No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.52,0:10:10.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-她才没有 -我才不要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.99,0:10:15.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here's the problem. I was clearly signed up to use the mainframe in Buckman 204...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.99,0:10:15.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}问题是这样的 是我先登记预约 贝克曼204实验室的主机…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.16,0:10:19.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and Dr. Winkle just ripped the sign-up sheet off the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.16,0:10:19.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}温克尔博士却把预约单从墙上撕下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.28,0:10:21.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It wasn't an official sign-up sheet. He printed it...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.28,0:10:21.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那根本不是正式的预约单 是他自己印的…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.87,0:10:25.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and he put his name down on every slot for the next six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.87,0:10:25.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后还把自己的名字 写在之后六个月的每个空格里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.54,0:10:28.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If it is a crime to ensure the university's resources...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.54,0:10:28.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果说确保学校的资源
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.29,0:10:31.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...are not being squandered chasing subatomic wild geese...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.29,0:10:31.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不浪费在追逐亚原子野鹅敢死队上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.26,0:10:32.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...then I plead guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.26,0:10:32.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么我认罪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.09,0:10:34.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PHONE RINGING]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.30,0:10:37.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.30,0:10:37.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.55,0:10:40.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You need to get that, Dr. Cooper? -God, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.55,0:10:40.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你得接电话吗 库珀博士？ -当然不用
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.52,0:10:43.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't turn it off. You might miss your call from Nobel...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.52,0:10:43.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别关机 不然你可能会错过 诺贝尔奖委员会打来的电话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.35,0:10:47.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...letting you know you've been nominated as dumb-ass laureate of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.35,0:10:47.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}通知你入围了本年度最佳白痴奖
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:51.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah, well, you wouldn't even be nominated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:51.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？你连被提名的资格都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.74,0:11:00.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have a series of important multi-loop calculations and simulations to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.74,0:11:00.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}盖布尓豪瑟博士 我有一系列 重要的多循环计算与模拟要处理
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.74,0:11:02.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's reducing irrelevant data, making a mock--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.74,0:11:03.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而她只是在减少不相干的数据 假装…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.87,0:11:03.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PHONE RINGS]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.08,0:11:05.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.08,0:11:05.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.71,0:11:07.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gablehauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.71,0:11:07.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是盖布尓豪瑟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.88,0:11:09.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.88,0:11:09.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是找你的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.38,0:11:14.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.38,0:11:14.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.26,0:11:17.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny, this is not a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.26,0:11:17.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 现在不行
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.93,0:11:21.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I told you, you're not prepared for the Sanctum of Burning Souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.93,0:11:21.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我跟你说过了 你还不能去灵魂燃烧圣堂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.18,0:11:27.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You need to be in a group of at least five and one should be a level 35 healer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.18,0:11:27.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得先参加五人以上的团体 并且其中一人要有35级的治愈力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.73,0:11:29.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I can't log on and help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.73,0:11:29.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 佩妮 我不能上线帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.11,0:11:33.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll talk when I get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.11,0:11:33.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等我回家再说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.49,0:11:41.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not getting the computing time, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.49,0:11:41.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我无法使用电脑了 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.62,0:11:43.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dumb-ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.62,0:11:43.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.54,0:11:50.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, you have to do something about Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.54,0:11:50.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 你得帮我想办法 来处理佩妮的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.13,0:11:53.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She is interfering with my sleep. She is interfering with my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.13,0:11:53.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她干扰我的睡眠 也打扰了我的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.34,0:11:55.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I had another significant aspect of my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.34,0:11:55.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我生命当中 还有另外一件重要的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.80,0:11:58.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I'm sure she'd be interfering with that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.80,0:11:58.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想她一定也会来打扰的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.64,0:12:02.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why should I do something? You introduced her to online gaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.64,0:12:02.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这关我什么事？ 是你把线上游戏介绍给她的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.89,0:12:07.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, yes, but you're the one who said hello to her when she moved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.89,0:12:07.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的 但她搬进来的时候 是你跟她问好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.48,0:12:11.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you'd simply restrained yourself, none of this would be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.48,0:12:11.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你当初管好自己 这些事情都不会发生了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.48,0:12:15.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well, just tell her to leave you alone. -I did. I told her. I texted her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.48,0:12:15.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你就叫她别烦你了 -我有 我说过了 我发短信给她
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.82,0:12:17.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I sent out a very emphatic Twitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.82,0:12:17.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还写了一个义正言辞的推文
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.86,0:12:21.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I changed my Facebook status to "Sheldon wishes Penny would leave him alone."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.86,0:12:21.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我甚至还把我的脸书状态 改为“谢尔顿希望佩妮别再烦他”
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.82,0:12:24.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know what else to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.82,0:12:24.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我实在不知道还能怎么办了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.33,0:12:26.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, what am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.33,0:12:26.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我又能怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.50,0:12:29.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you don't figure something out, I warn you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.50,0:12:29.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道 但如果你不快想办法 我警告你…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.00,0:12:32.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I shall become very difficult to live with.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.00,0:12:32.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我将会变得非常难以相处
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.38,0:12:38.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You mean, up until now we've been experiencing the happy fun-time Sheldon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.38,0:12:38.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是说到目前为止 我们认识的是快乐有趣的谢尔顿？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.51,0:12:41.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yes. -I'll go talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.51,0:12:41.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是的 -我去跟她谈谈吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.68,0:12:45.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, Fritz, I need you on my flank.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.68,0:12:45.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 费里兹 我需要你到我的侧面
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.56,0:12:46.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I don't know German.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.56,0:12:48.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我不会讲德语…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.85,0:12:48.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SPEAKING INDISTINCTLY]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.10,0:12:50.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.73,0:12:53.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, Penny? -Busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.73,0:12:53.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-佩妮？ -我在忙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.19,0:12:56.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I see that. Shouldn't you be at work?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.19,0:12:56.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看到了 你不用去工作吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.86,0:12:58.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't work on Mondays.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.86,0:12:58.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我周一不用工作
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.70,0:13:00.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.70,0:13:00.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今天是周四
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.70,0:13:06.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Listen, Penny-- -Ugh. Queen Penelope AFK. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.70,0:13:06.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-听着 佩妮… -佩妮洛普女王暂离 干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.37,0:13:11.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Uh....
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.37,0:13:11.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.21,0:13:12.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.21,0:13:12.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.42,0:13:16.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, sometimes people, good people, you know, they start playing these games.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.42,0:13:16.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有时候人们 是好人们 他们开始玩这些游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.84,0:13:20.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They find themselves, through no fault of their own, you know, kind of addicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.84,0:13:20.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后发现自己…这不是他们的错 发现自己上瘾了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.05,0:13:23.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, get to the point. I'm about to level up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.05,0:13:23.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 说重点 我的等级快要提升了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.09,0:13:27.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If a person doesn't have a sense of achievement in their real life...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.09,0:13:27.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果某人在现实生活当中 没有成就的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.56,0:13:31.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...it's easy to lose themselves in a world where a false sense of accomplishment--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.56,0:13:31.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们很容易在虚拟世界中 以为自己得到成就并且迷失自我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.14,0:13:35.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, jabber, jabber, jabber. Okay, boys, Queen Penelope's back online.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.14,0:13:35.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 你继续啰唆 大伙 佩妮洛普女王回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.02,0:13:38.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny, you've got...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.02,0:13:38.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.78,0:13:40.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Cheetos in your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.78,0:13:40.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你头发上有玉米条
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.70,0:13:44.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.70,0:13:44.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢了…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.79,0:13:50.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.88,0:13:59.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: Hey, Penny, it's me again, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.88,0:13:59.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 我又来了 我是莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.88,0:14:01.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: Leonard, I said, not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.88,0:14:01.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 我说过了 现在别烦我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.26,0:14:03.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: I'm just a little concerned about you and--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.26,0:14:03.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道 我只是有点担心你 还有…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.68,0:14:05.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: I said, not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.68,0:14:05.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我说现在不行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.18,0:14:07.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: Okay, maybe later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.18,0:14:07.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 那回头再说好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.85,0:14:11.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, guys. -Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.85,0:14:11.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-大家好 -你好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.18,0:14:14.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, what's with him? -Penny's been keeping him up at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.18,0:14:14.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他怎么了？ -佩妮都不让他睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.27,0:14:17.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.27,0:14:17.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.28,0:14:23.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But probably in a different way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.28,0:14:23.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但方式大概不太一样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:27.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's really hooked on "Age of Conan." She's playing non-stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:27.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她沉迷于《科南时代》 她一直不停地玩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.66,0:14:29.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yes, online gaming addiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.66,0:14:29.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是线上游戏上瘾症
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.83,0:14:34.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's nothing worse than having that multiplayer monkey on your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.83,0:14:34.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那种多人游戏来烦你的时候 真的是很不好受
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.33,0:14:38.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon, wake up. -Danger, danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.33,0:14:38.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 起床了 -危险…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.38,0:14:42.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Afternoon, men. Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.38,0:14:42.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位午安 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.67,0:14:46.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah, well, your attempt at juvenilizing me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.67,0:14:46.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你试图把我当成孩子…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.14,0:14:51.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...by excluding me from the set of adult males just-- Oh, I'm too tired to do this.
