Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.18,0:19:41.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-汤姆 请让我为你介绍佩妮 -佩妮 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.80,0:19:46.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, as long as I'm here, I'm on a quest with newbs, don't know what they're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.80,0:19:46.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 反正我都来了 我正跟 一群菜鸟展开征讨 他们一无所知
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.27,0:19:48.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Got one assassin, three spell casters, no tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.27,0:19:48.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有一个刺客、三个魔法师 但没有坦克
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.69,0:19:50.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Can we talk later? -No, I need you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.69,0:19:50.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们可以晚点再谈吗？ -不…我现在就需要你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.69,0:19:52.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wouldn't you prefer to socialize with Tom...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.69,0:19:52.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你不想先跟汤姆认识一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.86,0:19:55.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who is a sexually passive outdoorsman?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.86,0:19:55.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}汤姆在性方面很被动 也很喜欢户外活动
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.86,0:20:01.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Whatever, I'll figure it out myself. -Bye, Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.86,0:20:01.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-随便 我自己想办法吧 -佩妮 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.33,0:20:06.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, dude, she didn't look anything like her picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.33,0:20:06.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 老兄 她跟照片一点都不像
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.33,0:20:10.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They never do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.33,0:20:10.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她们都是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.76,0:20:18.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: Hello, fair Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.76,0:20:18.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的佩妮你好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.43,0:20:21.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: Who are you? HOWARD: It is I, Sir Howard of Wolowitz.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.43,0:20:21.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你是谁？ -我是沃洛威兹家族的霍华德公爵
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.22,0:20:26.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can I interest you in an afternoon of spirited questing...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.22,0:20:26.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我能不能邀请你 与我展开充满灵性的午后征讨
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.31,0:20:28.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...followed by a flagon of ale at yon virtual tavern?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.31,0:20:28.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后再去虚拟小酒馆 一起喝个麦芽啤酒？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.64,0:20:31.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: Yeah, sure, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.64,0:20:31.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然 有何不可
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.57,0:20:36.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God, I need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.57,0:20:36.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天 我真的快没救了
